  "description": "Returning student Youngseo finds himself increasingly distracted by Yechan, the unemployed neighbor next door. What started as casually looking out for someone who seems a little helpless soon becomes routine, and before he knows it, Youngseo’s feelings for Yechan begin to grow as well…\n\n*“I picked him myself and raised him. Ki Yechan isn’t someone a guy like you can handle.”*\n\nThe appearance of Yegeon, Yechan’s half-brother, sends a major shock through this sticky, spiderweb-like relationship.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000064889)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_4160)",
